===Verb===
{{infl|en|verb|head=[[to]] [[leave]] [[somebody|(somebody)]] [[in]] [[the]] [[lurch]]}}

#{{idiom}} To [[abandon]] somebody; especially, to abandon somebody and leave him or her in a [[difficult]] [[situation]].
#:''He '''left me in the lurch''' and I had to finish the whole project by myself.''

